# ~/.zshrc.local on the personal Mac Mini. Never committed.
# Start empty. Add only what is specific to this machine:
#   - Python toolchain, if it differs from the MacBook Pro
#   - container runtime (Docker Desktop rather than podman)
#   - audio/music tooling paths
#
# If uv is the only Python you want here, nothing is needed: uv installs to
# ~/.local/bin, which common.zsh already puts on PATH.
